{"t":"2026-11-10T04:20:44.579Z","mono":272153,"elapsedSec":270.1,"kind":"speech","phase":"turns","seat":"bo","text":"I'd planned a quiet morning of music on the green. Then my plans changed three times before breakfast: the pond hall, then the orchard, then not the orchard. I'm a shy sort, so I took it as a hint to stop and listen. It turns out the best song of the day was the one I hadn't planned.","atMs":1794284442745}
